| **pnpm add -g zmcp-tools** | Free-installation | Global installation via pnpm |
| **git clone + pnpm install** | Local deployment | Clone repo, install dependencies, build, and link globally |

**Notes:**
- No Smithery-related options marked [PROHIBITED]
- No Docker-related options marked [PROHIBITED]
- No remote deployment options (server runs locally via stdio transport)

